# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. Checked out with CRLF on Windows they fail on
# macOS and Linux with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M" — which is exactly what
# would happen to the hook, on the other developer's machine, silently.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Normalise the rest so the two of us don't trade whole-file diffs over line endings.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.ico binary
